    "turn_idx": 30,
    "turn_text": "Last question. Congressman Clyburn, there is a lot of grumbling on Capitol Hill as it relates to Nancy Pelosi. And there are names that are floating about and then I was told that if Nancy Pelosi does not make it as leader in the House, Democratic leader, it could be you. You could wind up being the Speaker of the House. And because everyone I've been hearing, they're talking about, they want new blood, new ideas. What would be your new ideas if there is this blue tsunami and you could wind up becoming the speaker of the house? One, do you want that position? And two, what would your ideas be if you do decide to actually go for that position?",
